140 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 79 0 R
/E (Artificial Intelligence \(AI\) has emerged as one of the most transformative technologies of the current decade, reshaping the way industries approach problem-solving, automation, and decision-making. As a Master of Computer Applications \(MCA\) student with a background in full-stack development \(JavaScript, Node.js, React, and MongoDB\), I undertook a one-month Artificial Intelligence Internship Program with Codec Technologies from 27 July 2026 to 27 August 2026 to build a strong practical foundation in AI, Machine Learning \(ML\), and Deep Learning \(DL\), and to apply these concepts to real, working projects.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
141 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 79 0 R
/E (The internship was structured as a progressive, four-week curriculum that moved from the fundamentals of Python-based data handling to classical machine learning, then into neural networks and deep learning, and finally into advanced applications such as Natural Language Processing \(NLP\) and Reinforcement Learning \(RL\), culminating in an independent capstone project. This report documents the concepts covered, the skills developed, the practical work undertaken, and the outcomes achieved during the internship.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
142 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 79 0 R
/E (The internship gave me the opportunity to move beyond theoretical knowledge of AI and actually build, train, evaluate, and refine machine learning models end-to-end - from raw data to a working, testable application - which has meaningfully strengthened my understanding of how AI systems are designed and deployed in practice.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
143 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 79 0 R
/T (4.2 Organization Profile)
/E (4.2 Organization Profile)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
144 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 79 0 R
/E (Codec Technologies \(https://codectechnologies.in/\) is a technology training and skill- development organization that offers structured, industry-oriented internship and certification programs for students and early-career professionals in emerging technology domains, including Artificial Intelligence, Machine Learning, Data Science, and related fields. The organization focuses on bridging the gap between academic coursework and industry-relevant, hands-on technical skills through mentor-guided, project-based learning.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
