/E (As part of its Artificial Intelligence Internship Program, Codec Technologies provides a structured curriculum, learning resources, and mentorship to help interns build practical competence in Python-based AI development, covering data handling, classical machine learning, deep learning, and advanced applications such as NLP, supported by a capstone project component to consolidate learning.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [1]
>>
