149 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 80 0 R
/E (Despite growing exposure to AI concepts through coursework and self-study, translating theoretical understanding of Machine Learning and Deep Learning into working, deployable solutions remains a significant challenge for most students. Common gaps include difficulty in preparing and cleaning real-world data, choosing the right model for a given problem, correctly evaluating model performance, and structuring a complete AI project from data ingestion through to a usable output.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
150 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 80 0 R
/E (The internship was designed to address this gap directly: rather than studying AI concepts in isolation, the program required implementing each concept as working code, and concluded with an independent capstone project that involved identifying a real classification problem, sourcing and preparing data, building and training a model, evaluating its performance, and packaging it as a usable tool.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
